{"id":386,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Deoxys emerged from a virus that came from space. It is highly intelligent and wields psychokinetic powers. This Pokémon shoots lasers from the crystalline organ on its chest."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"The DNA of a space virus underwent a sudden mutation upon exposure to a laser beam and resulted in Deoxys. The crystalline organ on this Pokémon’s chest appears to be its brain."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"DNA from a space virus mutated and became a Pokémon. It appears where auroras are seen."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"An alien virus that fell to earth on a meteor underwent a DNA mutation to become this Pokémon."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"When it changes form, an aurora appears. It absorbs attacks by altering its cellular structure."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"This DEOXYS has transformed into its aggressive guise. It can fool enemies by altering its appearance."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A POKéMON that mutated from an extraterrestrial virus exposed to a laser beam. Its body is configured for superior agility and speed."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Pressure","hidden":false,"description":"Puts other Pokémon under pressure, causing them to expend more PP to use their moves."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":120,"baseHappiness":0,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"rare","color":"Red","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":386,"name":"Deoxys","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,35],[1,43],[7,101],[13,100],[19,282],[25,473],[31,94],[37,356],[43,285],[49,428],[55,322],[61,105],[67,354],[73,63]],"machine":[332,97,280,347,451,399,409,203,412,797,263,7,430,374,411,248,416,447,356,63,58,8,196,286,282,113,67,490,800,417,101,220,398,182,60,244,94,917,678,473,240,115,156,157,317,184,247,285,214,76,446,707,500,164,241,129,36,851,675,87,9,86,85,2